[en.FOCUS_C18_000_AGRICULTURE_SUBSIDY]
Agricultural Subsidy

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_AGRICULTURE_SUBSIDY_desc]
Agriulture is the foundation of Kirin society. Subsidizing agriculture can ensure the basic livelihood of Kirin, and guarantee the supply of foals.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_AGRICULTURE_SUBSIDY]
农业补贴

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_AGRICULTURE_SUBSIDY_desc]
农业是麒麟社群的立国之本，对农业进行补贴可以保障麒麟的基本生计，同时保障稚马之息的供给。

